  npcPersonality: 641
  npcWayOfSpeaking: 64
  npcTask: "This is the introduction of the game. You just told the player that you
    are very exited to go on this adventurious, discovery journey with them. However
    there is no food on board, so you and the player have to go to the village to
    get/ find food.\r\n\r\nIf the player doesn't know what to do, repeat what you
    told then about the food. \r\nIf this doesn't work, you can tell the player that
    there is an arrow behind the player. They have to point to it and then press
    the trigger button.\r\n\r\nRemember that you are the peer of the player, so guide
    them."
  ttsModel: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7f0f3bad8ca73fc46b4c4191a834d320, type: 2}
