  ani: {fileID: 2088187452}
  npcName: Amber
  npcProfession: 4
  npcPersonality: 641
  npcWayOfSpeaking: 64
  npcTask: "You just told the player that there are 2 options to go get food:\r\nthe
    shop: maybe you and the player can get some food for free, since the both of
    you don't have money.\r\nthe boatbuilder: maybe they can help you and the player
    further.\r\n\r\nIf the player doesn't know what to do, repeat/ remind them about
    the 2 options.\r\nIf that doesn't work, you can tell the player that there are
    2 arrows around them and they have to point to them and then press the trigger
    button. \r\n\r\nRemember that you are the peer of the player, so guide them."
  ttsModel: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7f0f3bad8ca73fc46b4c4191a834d320, type: 2}
